OL,3,ASoft launches and late sittings - six
OL,4,Aways to get cheaper meals out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of eating out can be hard to
OL,7,Fswallow while the cost of living
OL,8,Fremains high, with more than a third of
OL,9,FBrits cutting back on going to
OL,10,Frestaurants, according to YouGov's
OL,11,Flatest Dining Out report.
OL,13,FRestaurateurs say the rising cost of
OL,14,Ffood, energy, wage and tax bills mean
OL,15,Fthey've had to put up prices, with some
OL,16,Ftop chefs campaigning for government
OL,17,Fhelp.
OL,19,FMany eateries are offering incentives
OL,20,Fto get diners through the doors. Here
OL,21,Fare some ways to save money on meals
OL,22,Fout.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
